<title>SWEDEN: Nordbanken says expansion hinges on profitability.</title>
<headline>Nordbanken says expansion hinges on profitability.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish state-controlled bank Nordbanken said on Thursday its possible expansion in the Nordic region outside its large company operations depended on profitability estimates.</p>
<p>&quot;We don't exclude anything and we are looking at different possibilities for the bank's development,&quot; Nordbanken chief executive Hans Dalborg told a news conference and analyst meeting.</p>
<p>&quot;We already exist in the Nordic region on the large company side. If we would expand this to also include other operations, profitability estimates will be decisive.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Jorgen Osterberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
